r}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/orgs\",\"repos_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/repos\",\"events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/events{/privacy}\",\"received_events_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/received_events\",\"type\":\"User\",\"user_view_type\":\"public\",\"site_admin\":false},\"jobs_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33556709397/jobs\",\"logs_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33556709397/logs\",\"check_suite_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/check-suites/90935885549\",\"artifacts_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33556709397/artifacts\",\"cancel_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33556709397/cancel\",\"rerun_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33556709397/rerun\",\"previous_attempt_url\":null,\"workflow_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/workflows/307082200\",\"head_commit\":{\"id\":\"11e3d173f51086d3ec4f1c6b18b111394cbf7681\",\"tree_id\":\"481ec5e81ff16217024d6f448c70e8128f0062b0\",\"message\":\"test(chain): make the chain engine testable and cover its failure paths\\n\\nrunStep called runner.ExecuteAndGetRunID directly, which shells out to\\n`gh workflow run`, and internal/exec's mutation guard panics on that during a\\ntest. So the part of the chain engine that decides whether a failed step aborts\\nthe rest had no test, and could not have one. The executor now takes the\\ndispatch and the poll interval as options, which took the package from 45% to\\n78% and pinned abort, continue, and stop.\\n\\nAlso names a run's logs after the run when no workflow name reached them, so\\n`:logs <run-id>` no longer titles the viewer \\\"Logs: \\\".\",