tte, since the packages call gh directly\\nrather than through a subprocess of the built binary.\\n\\nTwo cassettes are recorded against completed runs of the dispatch-only demo\\nworkflows, and TestRecorded_ replays them offline through the whole pipeline:\\nfetch, parse, filter, detect, export. Each fails against the bug it was written\\nfor -- the group-marker split, the stamped timestamp, the surviving escapes.\\nTestRecorded_FixturesMatchTheRecordedShape holds every remaining fixture to the\\nrecorded line shape, so a new one cannot be written in a format gh never emits.\\n\\nTestUpdate_AsyncMessagesReachTheirHandlersBehindAModal pins the routing that\\nlet a chain's status modal miss its own updates.\\n\\ncheck-test-safety.sh exempts a file that routes gh through a cassette, since a\\nreal executor there reaches the recording and never GitHub; it still rejects one\\nanywhere else.\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-01T04:05:43Z\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Kyle King\",\"email\":\"KyleKing@users.noreply.github.com\"},\"committer\":{\"name\":\"Kyle King\",\"email\":\"KyleKing@users.noreply.github.com\"}},\"repository\":{\"id\":1133962745,\"node_id\":\"R_kgDOQ5bl-Q\",\"name\":\"gh-lazydispatch\",\"full_name\":\"KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch\",\"private\":false,\"owner\":{\"login\":\"KyleKing\",\"id\":3784339,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODQzMzk=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3784339?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/KyleKing\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/gists{/gist_id}\",\"starred_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/starred{/owner}{/repo}\",\"subscriptions_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/subscriptions\",\"organizations_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/orgs\",\"repos_