azydispatch/actions/runs/33464425182/artifacts\",\"cancel_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33464425182/cancel\",\"rerun_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/runs/33464425182/rerun\",\"previous_attempt_url\":null,\"workflow_url\":\"https://api.github.com/repos/KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch/actions/workflows/223379934\",\"head_commit\":{\"id\":\"06bb35a8ae58d6ce77c98a5150652cdbbea91f49\",\"tree_id\":\"c8cb3e749d267e7767755db7d3d4a6960066a4d6\",\"message\":\"fix(ui): stop reserving pane borders twice, which cut every pane's content by two\\n\\nLipgloss v2 counts the border inside Width, so PaneStyle subtracting it again\\nleft each pane two columns narrower than its caller believed and its content\\nfour narrower. Chain rows built for the width the model was handed wrapped\\nmid-cell in the tabbed panel. The tabbed panel now renders exactly the frame it\\nis given at every width, which is what the new test asserts.\\n\\nAdds .github/lazydispatch.yml and a dispatch-only demo-chain-check workflow so\\nthe chain, log-export, and failure-detection paths can be exercised against a\\nreal run.\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-01T02:55:02Z\",\"author\":{\"name\":\"Kyle King\",\"email\":\"KyleKing@users.noreply.github.com\"},\"committer\":{\"name\":\"Kyle King\",\"email\":\"KyleKing@users.noreply.github.com\"}},\"repository\":{\"id\":1133962745,\"node_id\":\"R_kgDOQ5bl-Q\",\"name\":\"gh-lazydispatch\",\"full_name\":\"KyleKing/gh-lazydispatch\",\"private\":false,\"owner\":{\"login\":\"KyleKing\",\"id\":3784339,\"node_id\":\"MDQ6VXNlcjM3ODQzMzk=\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3784339?v=4\",\"gravatar_id\":\"\",\"url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing\",\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/KyleKing\",\"followers_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/followers\",\"following_url\":\"https://api.github.com/users/KyleKing/following{/other_user}\",\"gists_url\":\"https://api.github.c